fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstvalue.html#GstValueHashFunc","fragment":"\n\tGstValueHashFunc\n\n\n\tGst.ValueHashFunc\n\n\n\tGst.ValueHashFunc\n\nUsed by gst_value_hash to calculate a hash of value.\nParameters:\na GValue\na location to store the hash value\nTRUE, or FALSE if value cannot be hashed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nUsed by Gst.prototype.value_hash to calculate a hash of value.\nParameters:\na GObject.Value\nReturns a tuple made of:\ntrue, or false if value cannot be hashed.\ntrue, or false if value cannot be hashed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nUsed by Gst.value_hash to calculate a hash of value.\nParameters:\na GObject.Value\nReturns a tuple made of:\nTrue, or False if value cannot be hashed.\nTrue, or False if value cannot be hashed.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});